@startuml
!include _style.iuml
|Artisan|
start
:Register as an artisan
(SMS-verified number);
:Choose services, working
days and hours, location;
repeat
  :Submit verification
  documents (ID photo,
  personal photo,
  certificates);
  |Administrator|
  :Review the
  documents;
  |Artisan|
repeat while (Approved?) is (no: read the\nreason, resubmit) not (yes)
|System|
:Mark verified and
notify the artisan;
|Artisan|
if (Active plan?) then (no)
  :Start the 7-day trial
  or buy a 3, 6 or
  12-month plan;
else (yes)
endif
:Turn availability on;
|System|
:Include the artisan in
dispatch inside the
working hours;
|Artisan|
:Receive nearby requests
and send offers;
stop
@enduml
